ilegiada para quem busca viver com exclusividade em Curitiba\n\n\nEste imóvel está sujeito a alterações de valores (preço e demais taxas) e disponibilidade","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38710.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38711.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38712.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38713.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38714.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38715.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38716.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38717.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38718.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38719.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38720.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38721.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38722.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38723.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38724.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38725.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38726.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/MOC2825/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38727.jpg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox